{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301081","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301081","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230108101:1":{"text":"물론이죠! 이 헤이독을 찾아오시다니, 잘 오셨어요.","source_cn":"当然，问我海多克你算是找对人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE35A19D53165B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230108102:1":{"text":"식용을 찾으시는 거라면, 이끼 잉어를 추천해 드릴게요. 맛이 아주 좋습니다!","source_cn":"如果你是买来吃，那我推荐苔鲤，这种鱼的鱼肉非常鲜美！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC259E5CE8371230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230108103:1":{"text":"관상용을 찾으시는 거라면, 휘슬 피쉬를 추천하죠!","source_cn":"要是买观赏鱼，那我推荐你养啸鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E51C0AE43D8B807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230108104:1":{"text":"평소에는 조용하지만, 날씨가 갑자기 변하기 전에 어항에서 발버둥치면서 커다란 충돌음을 내거든요. 그래서 쓰나미를 피할 수 있어요!","source_cn":"这种鱼平时很安静，但是在气候巨变前，会在缸里拼命挣扎，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C5BA24071E8DA5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:鱼贩海多克":{"text":"생선 장수 헤이독","source":"鱼贩海多克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}